{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"傳道書","commonName":"傳道書","title":"傳道書","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"0820c676ad433f3511909fd6951fb4fcc4ff6d4c48e9ee637e3a4d5e7b84f784","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":3,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["萬物有時"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"天下萬物都有定期，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凡事都有定時。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"出生有時，死亡有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耕種有時，拔出有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"殺戮有時，醫治有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拆毀有時，建造有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哭泣有時，歡笑有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哀傷有時，雀躍有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拋石有時，堆石有時","poem":1},{"noteId":1},{"text":"；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"擁抱有時，避開有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋找有時，遺失有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"保存有時，丟棄有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"撕裂有時，縫合有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"沉默有時，發言有時；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愛慕有時，憎惡有時；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"爭戰有時，和好有時。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["那麼，人勞碌做工有什麼益處呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我察覺上帝給世人重擔，使他們忙碌不休。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["祂使萬事各按其時變得美好，又把永恆的意識放在人心裡，人卻不能測透上帝從始至終的作為。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["我認識到，人生在世沒有什麼比歡樂、享受更好。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["人人都該吃喝、享受自己勞苦的成果，這是上帝的恩賜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我知道，上帝所做的都會存到永遠，誰也不能增減。祂這樣安排是叫人敬畏祂。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["現在的事並不是新事，未來的事也早已發生過。上帝使過去的事再次出現。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["世間的不公"]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["我又看到日光之下，即使在公道和正義之地也有邪惡。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["我心裡想：「不論義人或惡人，上帝必審判，因為萬事萬務都有定時。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["我又想：「至於世人，上帝試驗他們，是要他們知道自己與獸類無異。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["因為人和獸的際遇並無分別，兩者都難逃一死，活著都靠一口氣。人並不比獸強，一切都是虛空。"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["兩者都同歸一處，出於塵土，也歸於塵土。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["誰知道人的氣息",{"noteId":2},"會向上升，獸的氣息會降到地下呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["因此，我覺得沒有什麼比人享受工作之樂更好，因為這是人當得的。人死後，誰能使他看到世間的事呢？"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":1,"caller":"+","text":"「拋石有時，堆石有時」意義不明，有猶太拉比說是「同房有時，分房有時」。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":5}},{"noteId":2,"caller":"+","text":"「氣息」或譯「靈」，本節同。","reference":{"chapter":3,"verse":21}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/3.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/4.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ECC/2.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}